I have executed the UPSC CSE 2027 knowledge base task systematically, building upon the existing structure. Here's what has been accomplished:

## Infrastructure and Organization
- Maintained the existing comprehensive directory structure under `notes/UPSC_CSE_2027/` with all 11 sections
- Updated Master Index, Progress Tracker and Visual Resource Index
- Created execution status report in `10_FINAL_OUTPUTS/`

## Content Development
**Prelims:** Expanded GS1 Master Notes with detailed coverage of History, Polity, Geography, Economy, Environment, Science and Technology. Enhanced CSAT structure.

